        <title>Glassy Host Updates</title>
        <link>https://glassydesk-host.pages.dev/glassy-host/appcast.xml</link>
        <description>Software updates for Glassy Host.</description>
        <item><title>Glassy Desk 0.2.5</title><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 11:28:07 +0000</pubDate><link>https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/tag/v0.2.5</link><sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.5</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;p&gt;Adds support for Paste to Mac in compatible Glassy Desk iPhone and iPad builds. Copy text on your device, then use Paste to Mac or Cmd-V while the remote desktop has focus to paste into the active Mac app. Requires Fast Connection.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Supports multiline text, emoji, and other Unicode characters, with up to 1 MB per paste. Clipboard transfer happens only when you paste, using the existing encrypted connection and native iOS paste actions to avoid repeated clipboard permission prompts.&lt;/p&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/download/v0.2.5/GlassyHost-0.2.5.zip" length="4280369" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="YLoleJqOzkYHcEkvM2f8VNg0Yu11FYqyAUBcY6QIPourGZVs2sTPbFewUwUryuixjj11VZCq62E+/MDNc/duBw==" /></item><item><title>Glassy Desk 0.2.4</title><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 01:31:39 +0000</pubDate><link>https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/tag/v0.2.4</link><sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.4</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;p&gt;Glassy Host is now Glassy Desk, matching the app on your iPhone and iPad.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
- A cleaner blue monitor icon makes Glassy Desk easier to spot in the Dock.&lt;br&gt;
- Updated menus, settings, and setup messages use the same name throughout the Mac app.&lt;br&gt;
- Clearer wording explains how to share your Mac with your iPhone or iPad.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Your paired devices and settings carry over to this update.&lt;/p&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/download/v0.2.4/GlassyHost-0.2.4.zip" length="4272602" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="vixSDovfSW7j14MQBC0IE4Nkjovpgx2PNULTJnLVF+FShO3LQTkGw7L72UU0r5Uv+Qkd+0Vce8EgiyZwH8B8Dw==" /></item><item><title>Glassy Host 0.2.3</title><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 23:54:09 +0000</pubDate><link>https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/tag/v0.2.3</link><sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;p&gt;Fixes an issue where double-tapping during a Glassy Stream session was treated as separate single clicks on the Mac, preventing files and folders from opening. Double clicks now follow your Mac&amp;#x27;s double-click speed setting.&lt;/p&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/download/v0.2.3/GlassyHost-0.2.3.zip" length="4590233" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="JQtzybzYw2yeqU5zb0q4QA94+EF9ZCcljiEddcULeEOXG6tRgsVKCPwnQSssJuJCNSfGPtee4OblOhxBaiYFBA==" /></item><item><title>Glassy Host 0.2.2</title><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 23:14:07 +0000</pubDate><link>https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/tag/v0.2.2</link><sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;p&gt;Maintenance rebuild of Glassy Host for macOS 14 and later. Streaming, pairing, and update behavior are unchanged from version 0.2.1.&lt;/p&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/download/v0.2.2/GlassyHost-0.2.2.zip" length="4584085" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="aOyZRnDOoB5VS8GNllaByLjn+czMLuHKI4I7vpkZFBa2c4CSosmOXueb1Jbqk3JVqELSrzHXd3d1oxlYqIw1Dg==" /></item><item><title>Glassy Host 0.2.1</title><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 23:27:08 +0000</pubDate><link>https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/tag/v0.2.1</link><sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;p&gt;Glassy Host now offers a compatibility QR code for older Glassy Desk clients, using the preferred active Tailscale or VPN route. Current clients continue to use secure identity-bound pairing with automatic LAN, Tailscale, and WireGuard route selection.&lt;/p&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/Bunn/GlassyDesk-Host/releases/download/v0.2.1/GlassyHost-0.2.1.zip" length="4584078" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="hyGjp60X+7rEEGdGIspKFp++TYjVZXGpBiZK44D9cF9pRyXUjB9JRFgJ2M2xKnYCG1JDGeWQeNBMzz00/Cp8Dw==" /></item><item>
